的文字一樣，只是少了兩個字，應該改成’倒數’第一，麵是白麵無味，湯頭不是拉麵的湯頭，也是淡而無味，點的雞排，跟前面評論的感覺一樣，肉不像雞肉，炸得脆脆的，但咬下去的口感，一整個怪到不行，叉燒燒焦味很重，我很後悔沒去吃附近的すき家就好，最後付錢還收服務費一成，傻眼，吃人夠夠，明明沒什麼服務還收，水也是我們自己來。真的不要勿踩這家店。另外送餐來時，應該是闆娘吧，和送餐的外勞小弟交會時，闆娘大大打外勞小弟屁屁，我想說我看到什麼。\n我記得兩年前來吃過，同個位置，不過那時餐廳在一樓，現在來到2樓，那時店名叫做滿味，現在改叫滿足，我心想不會是搬到對面的那家滿味拉麵吧，後來看了這兩家的近期評論，都是一顆星居多，而且兩家菜單價位都一樣，餐點一樣讓人後悔，推測都是同家老闆，騙非在地人。google map 的評論雖然是4星，但有可能是舊店家累積的評論，以近期的評論來參考要不要吃，不要輕易嘗試，真心不騙。",null,[0,74]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12133982543605856493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLYW1GclRraE5XRW95WkVSb1JsZ3dUbGhUYkhCeFQwWm9kMUpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12133982543605856493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLYW1GclRraE5XRW95WkVSb1JsZ3dUbGhUYkhCeFQwWm9kMUpWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12133982543605856493/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLYW1GclRraE5XRW95WkVSb1JsZ3dUbGhUYkhCeFQwWm9kMUpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12133982543605856493/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLYW1GclRraE5XRW95WkVSb1JsZ3dUbGhUYkhCeFQwWm9kMUpWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12133982543605856493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLYW1GclRraE5XRW95WkVSb1JsZ3dUbGhUYkhCeFQwWm9kMUpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12133982543605856493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLYW1GclRraE5XRW95WkVSb1JsZ3dUbGhUYkhCeFQwWm9kMUpWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,1112,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KamFrTkhNWEoyZERoRlgwTlhTbHBxT0Zod1JVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb8c3298b04fcfde7!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnJjakNHMXJ2dDhFX0NXSlpqOFhwRUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KamFrTkhNWEoyZERoRlgwTlhTbHBxT0Zod1JVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1